      "versionNonce": 728965894,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1741468985418,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果还有二进制位，继续，比如：\n还剩0，也就是 10110 = 0 + 2 * 11 = 22\n还剩1 ，也就是 10111 = 1  + 2 * 11 = 23",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果还有二进制位，继续，比如：\n还剩0，也就是 10110 = 0 + 2 * 11 = 22\n还剩1 ，也就是 10111 = 1  + 2 * 11 = 23",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
